In Scope
•	Completely safe and secure escorts that will be friendly and welcoming as they escort students and staff to their destinations.
•	The escorts will receive defensive training from the Police Department as well as the ability to administer basic first aid in case of an emergency.
•	Transportation of the escort service will be monitored by a higher party that will view the live locations of the escorts during transportation and ensure emergency personnel will be on scene in case of emergency.
•	The escort service will only be exclusive to the University of Texas at Dallas to ensure complete safety while developing a plan to get users to their destinations while protecting them from any outside threats.
•	Students and staff will be able to request an escort and review the job they did by responding to a survey to give feedback to improve any problems.


Out of Scope
•	The service will not function during all hours of the day. The service will be available during reasonable hours of the day but is not responsible for any activity or requests after a certain time.
•	Basic hardware to operate the app such as an escorts phone will not be provided by the team. It is assumed that both the users and the escorts will have a phone to use the app.
•	There will be no advertisements for the app for marketing to users or hiring escorts to minimize costs and budget allocations.
